## ⚠️ Satire & Liability Notice

This project is a **purely theoretical joke** and an exercise in computer science satire. 

Do **NOT** attempt to run this code in a production environment, do **NOT** disable ECC memory on critical systems, and please, for the love of physics, do **NOT** place radioactive materials from smoke detectors near your RAM. The author accepts absolute zero liability for fried components, regulatory investigations, or lack of timely solar flares.
